{
 "version": 1,
 "name": "wilds",
 "description": "Natural placement for the Synty Fantasy Kingdom nature set. Trees grow in groves (large-scale forest noise \u00d7 small-scale clumping) with glades between; forest edges carry the shrub belt; ferns, saplings and leaf litter cluster in the shade at tree feet; deadfall lies inside old stands. Boulders crop out where the ground is rocky and steep, with scree and pebbles strewn around them and down the fall line, and grass collars at their bases. Wildflowers bloom in single-species patches in open ground; grass is densest on the plains. Reeds stand in clumps at the water line and lily pads float in freshwater shallows.",
